  "helpSyncTitle": "Sync (optional)",
  "helpSyncBody": "Sync uses your own server: run the myDex sync server (see the project documentation), create an account and enter the address and access key under More → Sync. Changes are sent automatically a few seconds after you make them. All synced data is encrypted end-to-end with your sync password; use the same one on every device. If two devices change the same team or preset, both versions are kept – one as a copy marked \"conflict\". For collection marks, the newer change wins. On Android, sync is only available in the \"sync\" edition; the standard edition has no internet permission.",
